 ### [Training Loop with Adaptive Regularization & LR Decay](2408-training-loop-with-adaptive-regularization-lr-decay.md)
-Defines the iterative optimization procedure for training neural radiance fields, specifically focusing on the integration of adaptive regularization terms and exponential learning rate decay within the training loop. It solves the problem of stable convergence in high-dimensional implicit surface representations by combining reconstruction loss with structural priors (orthogonality, sparsity, and total variation) while gradually reducing the optimization step size. It builds on [NeRF Training Loop](970-nerf-training-loop.md) by specifying the exact loss composition and parameter update schedule [G].
